license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Original-study, supplementary and final-revision experiment runners for comparing spiking-neuron families, heterogeneous banks,
  input representations, and initialization stability on DIAT-μSAT radar and
  Spiking Heidelberg Digits. The package provides recorded configurations,
  pinned source and input fingerprints, numerical results, and model checkpoint
  generation. Datasets and previously measured results are not bundled.
  Portable-package validation was performed without new training; an end-to-end
  GPU rerun of this packaging has not been performed.
keywords:
  - spiking neural networks
  - neuron heterogeneity
  - initialization stability
  - radar
  - Spiking Heidelberg Digits
  - reproducibility
